{"posts":[{"id":"quasimodo_p7_151","t":"Bushido wrote: Hello!\n\nPlease free to comment/ask/judge.\n\nI have changed my former nickname ssirovnik to Bushido for personal reasons -just for info.\n\nHi Bushido, Nice collection here but how will you trade say example 1?Where entry,SL,TP?","a":"Lanceo","d":"","n":"#151","p":7,"im":["e04f791faca77fb3b62748078a8189540361dfde","db7a24f0a95e518a843fc83d470edb6f76a768d0","183fcc681258dff36adcb925ddbbaa7719d9ab4e","7b6b0bcd35e55b173dfc18ccda7b0674b4608c91","8379ef8acb652237297e7a96db4d405b236216ee","d26c961a25f9916b892fec2557d78ee168df1d69","b7badebf739bcb023c1a6f4457162f4c41f7a3be","7cfd7f7965cbe44a517150f73656c1a108c2c449"],"m":151},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_152","t":"Hello!\n\nThanks for the fast reply - see it more clearly now - concerning the approach.\n\nOut charts differ also in spikes. The daily TF is clear to me - yeah - strong demand on left created before.\n\nAlso some CP's arround this.","a":"Bushido","d":"","n":"#152","p":7,"im":["1bfca727dc064f014fddcb38e39488f3f353b348"],"m":152},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_153","t":"Hello Lanceo!\n\nSee attachment.","a":"Bushido","d":"","n":"#153","p":7,"im":["715e386d050f5e720333db893a226ed9cbdb843d"],"m":153},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_154","t":"Bushido wrote: Hello Lanceo!\n\nSee attachment.\n\nThank you, It is look I chosen easiest ones:)).I am not too much pattern man but I like your work here. All the best.","a":"Lanceo","d":"","n":"#154","p":7,"im":["715e386d050f5e720333db893a226ed9cbdb843d"],"m":154},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_155","t":"Trying to do thee HW's at my best - slowly i'm getting this S/D concept into the blood.","a":"Bushido","d":"","n":"#155","p":7,"im":[],"m":155},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_156","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#156","p":7,"im":["7b27145e0e4439a005c2b7c111b0a17b90bc9812"],"m":156},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_157","t":"Once again, I've spent some screen time and lo and behold, on the daily charts are quite a few, bouncing price between S/D. From far right, in the red, shows what appears to be a failed quasimodo. However, after the LL, price compressed back up to the daily S area, drawn in with white paint, before it shot back down to demand. To the right of that, drawn in on both green and blue are two others, firstly at demand which pushed price back to supply, and the opposite which shoved it back down. To the extreme right, in yellow appears what might be another quasimodo forming, time will tell.\n\nAt this point, its no surprise that with more and more homework being done, its surely getting easier to spot them.\n\nAnd here is the chart BTW......\n\nComments are quite welcome.","a":"Springger","d":"","n":"#157","p":7,"im":["f181903bc1fcccc134ed2915e9c84aa08345be1f"],"m":157},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_158","t":"Hi all\n\nHere I'll post my Quasimodo homework. Feel free to comment please.\n\nRegards, Ashkan","a":"Ashkan","d":"","n":"#158","p":7,"im":[],"m":158},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_159","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","n":"#159","p":7,"im":["4145f3ed2e53f0205c6680c8685151f0f3c297c0"],"m":159},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_160","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","n":"#160","p":7,"im":["f756c2d87b5433ca1319636f32bd4df1bce6b2c8"],"m":160},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_161","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","n":"#161","p":7,"im":["fd93e796e73bdcc56032b8fa6e5137e43db21694"],"m":161},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_162","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","n":"#162","p":7,"im":["f5adc741da345c8f3d8a6ab38741ab329e224df4"],"m":162},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_163","t":"For my part, looks good, keep it up. However, keep in mind that the Supply and Demand areas on HTF are more significant than on these LTF.\n\nKeep in mind that we are both in school, so i might also be wrong.\n\nBest Regards, spring","a":"Springger","d":"","n":"#163","p":7,"im":[],"m":163},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_164","t":"Hi Spring\n\nThanks for your comment. You're right, S/D on HTFs are more important. I'll try to find Quasimodo near S/D on HTFs.\n\nRegards, Ashkan","a":"Ashkan","d":"","n":"#164","p":7,"im":[],"m":164},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_165","t":"Hi,\n\nQuas